 " @return \<cword\> if needed: String
 function! s:cword_pattern(cword, config) abort
-    return printf((a:config.is_whole && a:cword =~# '\k' ? '\<%s\>' : '%s'), a:cword)
+    " Skip \<\> wrapping when the cword contains multibyte characters: Vim's
